      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَسُّ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَسِيس</span>, i. e., <i>low</i> or
<i>ignoble,</i> &amp;c.]. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا رَأَيْتُ أَخَسَّ مِنْهُ</span> [<i>I have
